### CRA-337 — Non-endorsable offence warning (DR-END-014)
### Requires: service running on localhost:4550, WireMock returning endorsableFlag per offence code
### Non-endorsable codes (WireMock stub): live-ne-end-trigger, live-ne-disq-trigger, live-ne-both-off
### Endorsable code (WireMock stub): live-ne-endorsable

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4550
@validateUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api/validation/validate

